5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need a structure that remains fair but doesn't alienate newcomers or create unnecessary visibility. I suggest we look at the taster forms and the mid-year records.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,A logical approach is best. I am curious about the administrative burden on our treasurer. I'll examine the logged hours and the bank statements.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I feel it is important to understand the actual usage of the club. I will look into the tally of sign-in sheets and the rota against attendance.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I've noticed a certain hesitation in the air lately. I want to know why. I'll check the weekday turnout and the winter social comments.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Takumi,,We can't just guess the numbers again. I want to know exactly what we are spending and who is actually paying. I'll take the ledger and the bank statements.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Benjamin, do you think the administrative side is the primary bottleneck here?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"It is a significant factor, Asuka. A system that is elegant on paper but a nightmare to manage is hardly a success.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I agree that management matters, but the social balance is equally vital.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"Precisely. If the members are second-guessing their attendance, the fee structure might be the culprit.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"I don't care how ""elegant"" it is if the bank account is empty. We need hard numbers first.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
